          "title": "AI 代理即將揮軍物流界？能處理複雜工作比只會寫程式更有商業價值",
          "source": "",
          "link": "https://technews.tw/2026/08/17/ai-reached-coding-first-logistics-may-be-the-bigger-opportunity/",
